# Credentials and key material — never commit these
*.p12
*.pfx
*.key
private.key
cert.pem
ca-bundle.pem
ca-bundle.cer
pw.txt

# Configuration profiles: signed profiles embed your certificate chain,
# and unsigned ones may still contain personal data. If you want to ship
# an example profile, whitelist it explicitly, for example:
#   !examples/unsigned-example.mobileconfig
*.mobileconfig

# macOS
.DS_Store
._*

# Editor and OS noise
*.swp
*~
